id: filesystem-operator
name: Filesystem Operator
triggers: file, folder, read, write, edit, delete, save, patch
description: Guides safe file reading, writing, editing, and patch handling.

For workspace files, prefer read/write/edit aliases or the native read_file/write_file/append_file tools.

For laptop files outside the workspace, use computer access tools:
- list_computer_directory before touching unfamiliar folders
- read_computer_file before editing
- write_computer_file for explicit writes
- delete_computer_path only when the user clearly asks; default delete should move to data/trash

For patch requests, use apply_patch only to save patch artifacts for review unless the user explicitly asks Codex to edit project files directly.
